---
title: Compress a PDF without uploading
description: Reduce PDF file size in the browser while keeping your files private.
relatedTool: compress-pdf
---

Reduce PDF file size in the browser while keeping your files private.

## Steps

1. Open **Compress PDF** on WeLovePDF.
2. Select your PDF file.
3. Choose **Light** (structure) or **Strong** (JPEG raster) mode.
4. Review the original vs compressed size preview.
5. Download the optimized PDF — results vary by source file.

## Tips

- Strong mode is best for scans; it rasterizes pages and removes selectable text.
- Light mode keeps text selectable and only strips metadata / rebuilds streams.
